souncdown (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Fast SoundCloud downloader with C++23
  * Real-time progress bars with speed and ETA
  * Playlist support with auto-numbering
  * Multiple format conversion (MP3, FLAC, WAV, AAC, OGG, OPUS)
  * Metadata and thumbnail embedding
  * OAuth token support for private tracks
  * No shell injection vulnerabilities

